{"id":"d79ea25f75d5218c","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-evaluation-respecting-per.md","title":"Evaluation-respecting PERs","display":"df-evaluation-respecting-per — Evaluation-respecting PERs","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-evaluation-respecting-per","aliases":["72-df-evaluation-respecting-per"],"display":"df-evaluation-respecting-per — Evaluation-respecting PERs","depends_on":["[[72-df-partial-equivalence-relation]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9","source_location":"Chapter X, section 3.9, E1-E2 and Kleene equality, printed pp.745-746 / PDF pp.757-758","source_statement_checked":true,"verification_status":"definition-contract-checked; source-statement-checked","proof_status":"not-applicable-definition","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_2026_10_22":"明确Kleene相等的等价关系性质及求值到同值的关系"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-evaluation-respecting-per"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-evaluation-respecting-per</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-evaluation-respecting-per — Evaluation-respecting PERs"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"855f0d0656844c14\" href=\"?note=855f0d0656844c14\" title=\"72-df-partial-equivalence-relation\">72-df-partial-equivalence-relation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Chapter X, section 3.9, E1-E2 and Kleene equality, printed pp.745-746 / PDF pp.757-758"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked; source-statement-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_2026_10_22","html":"明确Kleene相等的等价关系性质及求值到同值的关系"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 是闭项集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Downarrow\\subseteq T^2\">\\(\\Downarrow\\subseteq T^2\\)</span> 是固定求值关系。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\Downarrow v\">\\(t\\Downarrow v\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle t,v\\rangle\\in\\Downarrow\">\\(\\langle t,v\\rangle\\in\\Downarrow\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\Downarrow v\\land t\\Downarrow w\\Rightarrow v=w\">\\(t\\Downarrow v\\land t\\Downarrow w\\Rightarrow v=w\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\Downarrow v\\Rightarrow v\\Downarrow v\">\\(t\\Downarrow v\\Rightarrow v\\Downarrow v\\)</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq T^2\">\\(R\\subseteq T^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u,r,v,w\\in T\">\\(t,u,r,v,w\\in T\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PER}_T\">\\(\\operatorname{PER}_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"855f0d0656844c14\" href=\"?note=855f0d0656844c14\" title=\"72-df-partial-equivalence-relation\">72-df-partial-equivalence-relation</a>。下式引入 Kleene 相等 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}\">\\(\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}\\)</span>、值相容性 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VR}_{\\mathfrak e}\">\\(\\operatorname{VR}_{\\mathfrak e}\\)</span>、集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\">\\(\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\\)</span> 及任意关系的预求值扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^{\\Downarrow}\">\\(R^{\\Downarrow}\\)</span>。这些是元语言关系，不是项语法中的相等公式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"t\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}u\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall v\\in T\\;((t\\Downarrow v\\lor u\\Downarrow v)\\Rightarrow(t\\Downarrow v\\land u\\Downarrow v)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[t\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}u\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall v\\in T\\;((t\\Downarrow v\\lor u\\Downarrow v)\\Rightarrow(t\\Downarrow v\\land u\\Downarrow v)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VR}_{\\mathfrak e}(R)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall t,u,r\\in T\\;(t\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}u\\land \\langle t,r\\rangle\\in R\\Rightarrow\\langle u,r\\rangle\\in R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{VR}_{\\mathfrak e}(R)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall t,u,r\\in T\\;(t\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}u\\land \\langle t,r\\rangle\\in R\\Rightarrow\\langle u,r\\rangle\\in R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\\coloneqq\\{R\\in\\operatorname{PER}(T):\\operatorname{VR}_{\\mathfrak e}(R)\\},\\qquad\nR^{\\Downarrow}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle t,u\\rangle\\in T^2:\\exists v,w\\in T\\;(t\\Downarrow v\\land u\\Downarrow w\\land vRw)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\\coloneqq\\{R\\in\\operatorname{PER}(T):\\operatorname{VR}_{\\mathfrak e}(R)\\},\\qquad\nR^{\\Downarrow}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle t,u\\rangle\\in T^2:\\exists v,w\\in T\\;(t\\Downarrow v\\land u\\Downarrow w\\land vRw)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall t\\in T\\quad&amp;t\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}t,\\\\\n\\forall t,u\\in T\\quad&amp;t\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}u\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ u\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}t,\\\\\n\\forall t,u,v\\in T\\quad&amp;t\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}u\\land u\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}v\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ t\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}v,\\\\\n\\forall t,v\\in T\\quad&amp;t\\Downarrow v\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ t\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}v.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall t\\in T\\quad&amp;t\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}t,\\\\\n\\forall t,u\\in T\\quad&amp;t\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}u\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ u\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}t,\\\\\n\\forall t,u,v\\in T\\quad&amp;t\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}u\\land u\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}v\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ t\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}v,\\\\\n\\forall t,v\\in T\\quad&amp;t\\Downarrow v\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ t\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}v.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>依据p.746明确采用Kleene相等饱和的值相容性：若两个项都无值，它们Kleene相等；若任一有值，两者须得到同一值。确定性和幂等性使 t↓v 蕴涵 t≃v，故该条件包含通常的求值封闭要求。这里没有把“所有项都终止”加入假设，也没有把Kleene相等当作句法相等。预求值扩张中的两个存在见证各自绑定；任意R均可作扩张，未断言任意R的扩张都是PER。</p>\n<p>自反和对称由定义直接成立。传递时，任一端若有值，中间项及另一端都由两个Kleene相等式取得同一值；都无值时条件真空成立。最后一式用确定性和幂等性：t的唯一值为v，且v自求值。预求值扩张的进一步性质见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b9c13fa158735675\" href=\"?note=b9c13fa158735675\" title=\"72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift\">72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift</a>；该链接是后续定理，不加入定义依赖以免循环。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-partial-equivalence-relation","status":"resolved","id":"855f0d0656844c14","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-partial-equivalence-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-partial-equivalence-relation","status":"resolved","id":"855f0d0656844c14","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$R\\subseteq T^2$，$t,u,r,v,w\\in T$；$\\operatorname{PER}_T$ 见 [[72-df-partial-equivalence-relation]]。下式引入 Kleene 相等 $\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}$、值相容性 $\\operatorname{VR}_{\\mathfrak e}$、集合 $\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)$ 及任意关系的预求值扩张 $R^{\\Downarrow}$。这些是元语言关系，不是项语法中的相等公式。","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift","status":"resolved","id":"b9c13fa158735675","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"自反和对称由定义直接成立。传递时，任一端若有值，中间项及另一端都由两个Kleene相等式取得同一值；都无值时条件真空成立。最后一式用确定性和幂等性：t的唯一值为v，且v自求值。预求值扩张的进一步性质见 [[72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift]]；该链接是后续定理，不加入定义依赖以免循环。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Downarrow\\subseteq T^2","display":false},{"tex":"t\\Downarrow v","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle t,v\\rangle\\in\\Downarrow","display":false},{"tex":"t\\Downarrow v\\land t\\Downarrow w\\Rightarrow v=w","display":false},{"tex":"t\\Downarrow v\\Rightarrow v\\Downarrow v","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq T^2","display":false},{"tex":"t,u,r,v,w\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PER}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VR}_{\\mathfrak e}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)","display":false},{"tex":"R^{\\Downarrow}","display":false},{"tex":"t\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}u\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall v\\in T\\;((t\\Downarrow v\\lor u\\Downarrow v)\\Rightarrow(t\\Downarrow v\\land u\\Downarrow v)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VR}_{\\mathfrak e}(R)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall t,u,r\\in T\\;(t\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}u\\land \\langle t,r\\rangle\\in R\\Rightarrow\\langle u,r\\rangle\\in R).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\\coloneqq\\{R\\in\\operatorname{PER}(T):\\operatorname{VR}_{\\mathfrak e}(R)\\},\\qquad\nR^{\\Downarrow}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle t,u\\rangle\\in T^2:\\exists v,w\\in T\\;(t\\Downarrow v\\land u\\Downarrow w\\land vRw)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall t\\in T\\quad&t\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}t,\\\\\n\\forall t,u\\in T\\quad&t\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}u\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ u\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}t,\\\\\n\\forall t,u,v\\in T\\quad&t\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}u\\land u\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}v\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ t\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}v,\\\\\n\\forall t,v\\in T\\quad&t\\Downarrow v\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ t\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}v.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3381,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-408","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-evaluation-respecting-per|df-evaluation-respecting-per — Evaluation-respecting PERs]]"},{"id":"b6318833c3cb4f67","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle$ 取 [[72-df-evaluation-respecting-per]]。固定 $\\mathsf{Lam}\\subseteq T$，且 $\\forall v\\in\\mathsf{Lam}\\ (v\\Downarrow v)$；$\\operatorname{app}:T^2\\to T$ 是给定闭应用项构造。它们是结构参数，不是待证明存在的函数值。"},{"id":"a4db441ff403134f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle$、$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)$。给定单射 $\\mathsf{inl},\\mathsf{inr}:T\\to T$，两像不交，且每个注入项自求值；采用 [[72-df-evaluation-respecting-per]]、[[72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift]] 的扩张。"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-406","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[df-evaluation-respecting-per — Evaluation-respecting PERs](72-df-evaluation-respecting-per.md)"},{"id":"48778817c308e85e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle$ 满足 [[72-df-evaluation-respecting-per]] 的确定、幂等求值条件。给定 $\\mathsf z\\in T$ 与单射 $\\mathsf{su}:T\\to T$，$\\mathsf z\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathsf{su})$，且 $\\mathsf z\\Downarrow\\mathsf z$、$\\mathsf{su}(a)\\Downarrow\\mathsf{su}(a)$ 对所有 a∈T 成立。"},{"id":"5c65f237e17c892c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[72-df-evaluation-respecting-per]] 的 $\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle$ 与 $R^{\\Downarrow}$。$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)$。"},{"id":"9e7370aef3007b80","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[72-df-evaluation-respecting-per]] 的 $\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle$ 与 $\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)$，以及 [[72-df-partial-equivalence-relation]] 的 $|E|$。"},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-40","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-evaluation-respecting-per]]"},{"id":"9d782aac0c1a67b9","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-442","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-evaluation-respecting-per|df-evaluation-respecting-per — Evaluation-respecting PERs]]"},{"id":"b9c13fa158735675","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle$ 满足 [[72-df-evaluation-respecting-per]] 的确定性、幂等性；$R,S\\subseteq T^2$，$R^\\Downarrow,\\operatorname{PER}(T),\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)$ 均取该接口。"},{"id":"f6f38fb4ec14b41d","anchor":"ref-40","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-evaluation-respecting-per]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-87","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-evaluation-respecting-per]]"}],"outgoing":["855f0d0656844c14","b9c13fa158735675"]}